Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.48,0:00:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This definitely looks like the\NLabyrinth Stratum's Transfer Circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.98,0:00:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet Kerrioll tampered with the\NOrigin Stratum's Transfer Circle,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which I should have known he would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what you're telling me is\Nthat we've lost control over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't think all is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I seriously doubt his side\Nknows who got sent where.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Transfer Circle doesn't have enough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power to return us to\NClearflow Lake Stratum,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do know that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:30.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll need a magic stone that's\Nbeen charged up with power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the Hunters Association\Nis the best place to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.18,0:00:46.02,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine, {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.38,0:00:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But inside, I've still got a human soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.40,0:00:59.28,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine, {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.98,0:00:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back\Nof my super strong partner, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.14,0:01:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:01:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, surely!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.11,0:02:19.99,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(734,438)\fscx65\pos(478,53)}The Animals and the Girl
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.76,0:02:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to running out of preserved food, so\NBoxo's arrival is quite the boon to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.66,0:02:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you all.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.50,0:02:38.42,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord2\shad0\fs21\3c&H1F0C9C&}Disaster Relief\NVending Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Labyrinth Stratum was struggling\Nwith its own monster assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.44,0:02:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are actual vending machines that\Ndon't charge during times of disaster
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.26,0:02:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I tried taking a page from\Ntheir book by vending for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.76,0:02:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Labyrinth, have you\Nnoticed any strangeness here lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're referring to the wonkiness\Nwith the transfer circle, I assume.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.22,0:02:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not only that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.62,0:02:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's been a huge increase\Nin monster attacks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're controlled by the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.96,0:02:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the name of the Demon\NLord's nefarious left-arm general.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.34,0:03:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness, I had no idea\Nit was that serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.96,0:03:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.14,0:03:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I shouldn't be surprised\Nthat info hadn't reached me when
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.68,0:03:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone knows I'm the least capable\Nout of all the Stratum directors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.24,0:03:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely not cut out for this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.72,0:03:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This poor director.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.42,0:03:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has zero confidence.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.67,0:03:17.17,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fscx86\an2\pos(320,295)}Labyrinth Stratum Hunters Association
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.86,0:03:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His food is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.40,0:03:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so thankful! Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone seems happy with the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I checked for a magic stone at the item\Nshop, but it seems they're out of stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.40,0:03:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.54,0:03:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we aren't going anywhere as long\Nas the transfer circle won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have an idea for how\Nto get a magic stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.64,0:03:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, could you adjust the\Ntransfer circle and see if that helps matters?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try, but no promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.44,0:03:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a co-in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he's one step ahead, huh, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.74,0:03:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I plan to venture into the labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.80,0:03:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Duh-er-axe t-er-la-insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe some hunters survived the attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we have no time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Boxer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.84,0:04:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.75,0:04:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you so very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.56,0:04:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.22,0:04:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.13,0:04:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like a normal\Nreaction to the sight of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.32,0:04:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a bear carrying a\Ncardboard vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this one is with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.10,0:04:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, um, that one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness, did that box just change shape?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.62,0:04:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The details can wait,\Nbut for the time being,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should think of our friend\Nas a special magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.87,0:04:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, magic item. Hello there.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.88,0:04:45.76,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs27\pos(318,295)}Kikoyu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, the magic item responded.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for the monsters, you may leave\Nit to these two to defeat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.80,0:04:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, cover your ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.06,0:05:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something tells me they could have\Nhandled this just fine without our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.46,0:05:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I've never heard of an Unasusu and\Na Karios that could overwhelm monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.04,0:05:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These two are unique among their kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.14,0:05:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're outstanding and very friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a certain someone's\Npower made them stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.74,0:05:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A certain someone's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.46,0:05:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Color me curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.98,0:05:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will clean up this mess,\Nso please be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that dirt ball thingy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to ask, what is\Nthat dirt ball thingy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.16,0:05:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain, but first things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.30,0:05:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would it be an imposition if I\Nasked who the two of you might be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.62,0:05:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon my rudeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Director Bear, head of the Hunter's\NAssociation on Clearflow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.28,0:05:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This here is Boxxo, and he's a magic item\Nwith the mind and soul of a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.82,0:05:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's fully sentient and a dependable\Nally, someone you can talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A human consciousness\Ncontained within a magic item?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.22,0:05:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's a bit like\Nthat certain someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.08,0:06:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who could she be talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now please allow me to\Nintroduce myself and my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Kikuyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The white unasusu is Botan,\Nthe black Karios is Kuroyata.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on what I saw of that battle,\Nthese two are exceptionally strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes me wonder if the girl\Nhas any power of her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My powers are the ability to\Ncontrol a tiny amount of cold air.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.26,0:06:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the ability to move\Nwhile concealing my presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.36,0:06:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.27,0:06:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if she can mask her presence,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.88,0:06:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she could just hide while the\Nothers handle all the combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.36,0:06:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.92,0:06:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am always relying on\NKuroyata and Botan to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.34,0:06:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that makes her an animal handler?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.68,0:06:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I am not an animal handler.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are smart enough to think on their\Nown and comprehend complex situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.88,0:06:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am simply their friend\Nwho benefits from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.18,0:06:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kikuyu, would it be uncouth of me\Nto ask whom you're speaking with?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With me, that's who.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.98,0:06:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was she answering me even\Nthough I wasn't vocalizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, I can hear the inner voice of any\Nmaterial being that I am able to touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.10,0:07:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.90,0:07:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but it was rude of me to do\Nthat without asking permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Ease! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.30,0:07:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, if you're hungry, we can have a\Nquick snack while we get acquainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.36,0:07:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, let's do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mealtime means it's my time, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.43,0:07:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then as thanks, I shall provide\Nthe food for our little repass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.56,0:07:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.48,0:07:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not about to grow a plant\Nfor us to eat right now, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the world does\Nthat strange magic work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only does this piece\Nof field absorb monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.94,0:07:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and transform their bodies into nutrients!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.16,0:07:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you plant and water a seedling,\Nmy friend can make it grow rapidly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she call the dirt\Nball a piece of field?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:08:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will be a short while\Nbefore it finishes cooking,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.44,0:08:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I will tell you a little\Nmore about us in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.72,0:08:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must preface by saying that you might\Nfind this story difficult to believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.80,0:08:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it is all true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.22,0:08:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so, this is the story\Nof a very kind field.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once upon a time, there was an old\Nwoman living in a remote village.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then one day, out of the blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she found that there was a\Nsoul dwelling in her field.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.36,0:08:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a person who had come from\Nanother world and turned into a field.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.26,0:08:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He couldn't speak to her, but every\Nday, the old woman cultivated him. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.26,0:08:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A soul inhabiting a field?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.94,0:08:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.98,0:08:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess a soul inside a\Nvending machine has no room to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, since it came from another world,\Nour circumstances are very similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.04,0:08:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day, the old woman passed away,\Nand the field was left all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, even a field like him had\Nmanaged to make some animal friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By animal, does she\Nmean Kuroyata and Botan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.74,0:08:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He spent many quiet days with the animals,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:09:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,until one day, a girl came\Nalong, fleeing from something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.78,0:09:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The field took pity on her and\Nrescued her from her pursuers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.66,0:09:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The field wanted to save even more\Npeople, and it went on a journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eventually arriving at a\Nfortified city in the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.22,0:09:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This might sound odd coming\Nfrom a vending machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.28,0:09:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but a field going on a journey\Nsounds too far-fetched even for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.42,0:09:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a fierce battle going on there
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.10,0:09:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,between the citizens and\Nthe Demon Lord's forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The field saw it as an opportunity\Nand threw himself into the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.82,0:09:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite being a field.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.16,0:09:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The field managed to drive\Nback the Demon Lord's forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.86,0:09:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,earning a temporary time of\Npeace for the fortified city.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.08,0:09:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This field kicks ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he marched into the Demon Lord's\Nstronghold and fought fiercely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.82,0:09:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,allowing his friends to flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once his friends had escaped, the\Nfield shut down his consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.30,0:09:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this story were about a hero,\NI might be really inspired by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.66,0:09:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the main character is a field.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.16,0:09:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, given how Kiku, you called\Nthat thing the piece of field,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can safely assume she and the\Nanimals were the friends who got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.02,0:09:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wanted to go see Field in his entirety,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.06,0:10:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we couldn't make it past the\Nhuge wall that's blocking the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.14,0:10:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,road leading from the fortified\Ncity to the Demon Lord's domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then we heard a rumor we\Nthought could be of use to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the Demon Lord's left-arm\Ngeneral is here in this dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.58,0:10:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That information is what\Nled us to this stratum,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that about catches us up to now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.94,0:10:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo! Voxo! Voxo?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.93,0:10:20.01,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20\pos(488,133)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, that's the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means that even if I manage\Nto meet with the Netherlord,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's still unlikely that I could\Nget him to tell me the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, these are ready to eat! Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.14,0:10:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is delicious, moist, and fluffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.72,0:10:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an explosion of\Nsweetness in my mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.98,0:10:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so delighted that you enjoy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this isn't even\None-tenth as good as the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,vegetables I used to\Nharvest from Field himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.06,0:10:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one-tenth is even a\Nlittle too high, I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegetables ten times better than that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.48,0:10:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.39,0:10:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, they've got nothing to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will go well with\Nroasted sweet potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.88,0:11:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my, what are those floating things?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.78,0:11:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait, Boxo produced\Nsome drinks for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you do is open the lid like so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.98,0:11:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's so cold and tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.38,0:11:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Boxo has the ability\Nto serve cold drinks?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.22,0:11:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, much more than just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He provides food and all\Nkinds of other goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a dependable guy, that Boxo. Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.08,0:11:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Field was able to produce any kind\Nof vegetable you could think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.10,0:11:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo sounds surprisingly\Nsimilar to him after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.92,0:11:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.83,0:11:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something I really\Nwant to tell Kikoyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.48,0:11:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say that you also came\Nhere from another world? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.24,0:11:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem the soul inside Boxo is\Nnot of our world, just like your field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.02,0:11:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.93,0:11:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I wonder if he might even have\Ncome from the same place his field did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.08,0:11:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we manage to make our way to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should try talking\Nto him about such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:12:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's Japanese like me, then I'll have\Nall kinds of things to discuss with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.74,0:12:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've joined forces and are\Ntraveling with Kikoyu now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.34,0:12:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means I get to ride in the cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting darker by the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.60,0:12:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it would be wise if\Nwe camped here for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.46,0:12:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what are these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.86,0:12:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And these other round things are too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.16,0:12:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad she seems to like the food,\Nbut it's time to seal the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know the way to a lady's\Nheart is through her taste buds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.73,0:12:39.90,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H435D83&\3c&H8CB8E8&\shad0\bord2\fs19}Family Market
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.90,0:12:41.65,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (white),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H1F3A80&\3c&H5382C1&\shad0\fs15}Creamy Pudding\N {\c&H687096&\3c&H3B3C52&}Yummy Yogurt\N{\c&H3A51AE&\3c&H1D2F96&} Strawberry Yogurt\N {\c&H353DD6&\3c&H5D89C3&}Strawberry Shortcake
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.82,0:12:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, a whole new set of items?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.10,0:12:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some eaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.28,0:12:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen so many sweets before!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.18,0:12:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.22,0:12:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This texture is completely\Nnew to me, and I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.14,0:12:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's try this next.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.50,0:13:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I must say,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.04,0:13:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this would be even more\Noutrageously delicious if
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.40,0:13:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it had been made with the\Nfruit that field had grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.68,0:13:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd like to sample that myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.96,0:13:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm sorry, but might I trouble\Nyou for something to eat, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.28,0:13:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My bad, Director!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.64,0:13:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Boxo, what do you think of Kikoyu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.68,0:13:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice-ca-ed. Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's considerate and very smart, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much so that her mind and\Nappearance don't seem to match.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.18,0:13:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You rarely see children her age\Nwho have such strong character.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.02,0:13:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, they don't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.88,0:13:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, it seems\Nunlikely that Kikuyu is a human child.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on her looks and abilities,\Nshe must be some other race.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.54,0:13:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably a snow child.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.18,0:13:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A snow child?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.70,0:13:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that until a\Nsnow child becomes an adult,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they retain the form of\Na six-year-old child.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:13:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So their appearance doesn't\Nmatch their true age.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.92,0:14:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The snow children have\Nvery special powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For that reason, they're a highly targeted\Nrace and they're in danger of extinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, until we met Kikuyu, I\Nthought they were already extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.40,0:14:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Special powers that everyone goes after?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.20,0:14:15.04,sign_1513_19_Kokuuma_Cream_of,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H769BB0&\3c&H12319E&\fs20}Kokuuma Cream of Corn Soup
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.04,0:14:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legend has it that if you behead a snow\Nchild on the day it becomes an adult,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they will transform into a magical\Nice statue that will never melt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.78,0:14:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for the severed head,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it will continue to utter\Ncurses that have the power
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to contaminate entire\Nregions in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.82,0:14:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear there are whole\Nnations that perish that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.80,0:14:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a killer power, but what it\Ntakes to invoke it is too cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.66,0:14:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beheading someone to cast a\Ncurse is a horrible thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's not the end of it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.98,0:14:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Headless Ice Statue becomes a\Nsort of catch-all curse remover.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.94,0:14:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just place it next to a cursed person,\Nand it will cleanse them of any hex.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.58,0:14:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It removes curses?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.40,0:14:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Co-A-P-A-T-E!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.28,0:14:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt that it could\Ndispel Kerry Oil's son's affliction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.94,0:15:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, if the Captain knew about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is why we mustn't utter\Nthis knowledge to a solitary soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The secret must remain hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.62,0:15:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, we can't\Nlet this girl end up a victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.62,0:15:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A magic stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.20,0:15:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't know if it's powerful enough\Nto get the transfer circle up and running.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.64,0:15:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without Hulemy, we don't know how much\Npower we need from the magic stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.38,0:15:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better rendezvous with\NHulemy and see what's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.90,0:15:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems it can't pass through after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.22,0:15:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already tried it once before,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.22,0:15:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't believe there's any way\Nto get this piece of field through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.34,0:15:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard this barrier can\Ndetect monster wavelengths
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.00,0:15:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and prevent the passage of those energies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.28,0:15:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet the piece of\Nfield-absorbed monsters soaked up
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.08,0:15:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their wavelengths and the barrier\Ncan't tell the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.80,0:15:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.46,0:16:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't leave field behind here\Nwithout worrying something bad will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still one thing\Nthat I'd like to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.56,0:16:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Kikoyu, try to cross now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.42,0:16:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Bokso's barrier can successfully\Ninterrupt the labyrinth barrier,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, nice to meet you on this\Nside, Kikoyu, Kuroyata, and Botan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.48,0:16:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.44,0:16:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're back to square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.20,0:16:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we made some dependable friends,\Nand that's always a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.48,0:16:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Bear,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.98,0:16:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finished adjusting the transfer circle\Nso I can accompany you all next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.42,0:16:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.33,0:16:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be most welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.36,0:16:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We spent the night at an inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.88,0:16:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we ventured into\Nthe labyrinth once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.32,0:16:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After much discussion,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.86,0:16:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we arrived at the conclusion that rather\Nthan do an exhaustive search for stones,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.82,0:16:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should try to defeat the dangerous Lava\NFiend monster and get its magic stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.78,0:17:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That lava fiend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's more dangerous\Nthan a stratum lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.90,0:17:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But both Hulemy and Director\NBear thought we'd be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.26,0:17:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with such a formidable party.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then shall I have Kuroyata fly above\Nthe maze and seek out the lava fiend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wouldn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.16,0:17:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.26,0:17:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuroyata, please do as I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.40,0:17:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might as well end the search for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.42,0:17:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's start setting up camp. Good call.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.18,0:17:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So are you two gonna duke it out to\Nsee who gets to make dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.06,0:17:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo was in charge yesterday, so it\Nseems only fair that I do it tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.18,0:17:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could add da oo-it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.16,0:17:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, you take it easy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fresh vegetables are good for your skin,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.94,0:17:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they also help prevent\Nall kinds of diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.50,0:17:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I da oo-s will eat still.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.46,0:17:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you just say sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Hulemy craves sweets\Nafter she's had a strenuous think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.90,0:17:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And her favorite guilty pleasure\Nfoods are all full of sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.44,0:17:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Bear sounds non-committal,\Nbut I know what my regulars' faves are.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.84,0:17:57.13,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H957823&\bord0\shad0\an8\pos(334,45)\fs22\fad(318,1)}Family Market
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.74,0:17:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bear's gotta have their salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.62,0:18:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if he can resist\Nthis veritable salmon torrent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.44,0:18:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, dang, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.74,0:18:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, why don't we just go with\NBoxo's goods for this evening's meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.34,0:18:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No objections from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, no fair, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.04,0:18:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.94,0:18:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.22,0:18:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the sweet taste of\Nyesterday's victory still fresh,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.18,0:18:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got some sleep last\Nnight, a rarity for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kikuyu stood watch from late\Nnight until early morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I was able to sleep soundly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I'd better start making\Nbreakfast for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Boxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made some soup that's loaded with\Nvegetables, and it's very good for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.66,0:18:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.57,0:18:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was her secret plan all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.84,0:18:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, so savory!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.36,0:18:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The flavor is amazing, and\Nit's so restorative, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Kariata!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.56,0:18:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.52,0:18:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems Kuroyata has\Nfound the Lava Fiend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.56,0:19:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we know where it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can share my strategy for\Ndefeating it before we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.18,0:19:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be somewhere around here. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it goes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's a wall I built\Nusing giant concrete slabs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.30,0:19:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I didn't stop there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.76,0:19:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I built two walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now why did I do such a thing, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.68,0:19:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have fun in your icy bath, Lava Fiend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.84,0:19:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No heat stands a chance against\Nthat much ice water, not even yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.84,0:19:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though it might have only hardened your\Noutside, that's good enough for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.38,0:19:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to Hulemy, the Lava\NFiend's weak point is its throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might win an extra item!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.72,0:19:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to your next use.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.08,0:20:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.06,0:20:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It regenerated?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.26,0:20:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ain't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.90,0:20:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.76,0:20:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, could it be... no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.80,0:20:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stratum split?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.46,0:20:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.98,0:20:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.04,0:20:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.38,0:20:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doofus must have helped\Nherself to my inventions again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.79,0:20:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.16,0:20:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, who's this bird guy? End!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.86,0:20:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're together again! Bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.56,0:20:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you mad at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.37,0:20:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.29,0:20:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Boxxo, please don't be mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.70,0:20:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have died if\Nsomething went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.56,0:20:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you've got an explanation,\Nwe would like to hear it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.42,0:20:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, shouldn't this be the part\Nwhere we're happy to see each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.88,0:20:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:21:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us what happened since we last saw\Nyou and how you came to fall from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.24,0:21:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, right\Nafter I last saw you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.98,0:21:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Origin and I were lucky enough to\Ntransfer to the Clear Flow Lake stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.88,0:21:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I remembered how\NDirector Bear said if you hit
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.98,0:21:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a stratum split real hard\Nat exactly the right spot,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you might be able to make it split again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.38,0:21:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then Hulami's magic item\Nthat lets you safely drop
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from high up and the one\Nthat freezes water were just,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.32,0:21:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.23,0:21:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Hulemy wasn't around\Nto ask, so I used him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.30,0:21:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.21,0:21:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so I kind of punched the\Nfrozen pond with all my might.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.88,0:21:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then the stratum split again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.22,0:21:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I just sort of tumbled\Ndown into the crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.60,0:21:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.54,0:21:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those deep sighs are definitely warranted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.32,0:21:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was all too impulsive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.24,0:21:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Lamas, what if we hadn't\Nbeen in the labyrinth stratum?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.70,0:21:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you have done?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.44,0:21:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.36,0:21:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.82,0:21:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite the leap of faith!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.46,0:21:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most important thing\Nis that you're safe, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.08,0:21:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I want you to realize we're all angry
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.06,0:21:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because we care about you\Nand what happens to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.26,0:21:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sorry if I had you guys worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.70,0:22:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we're together\Nand that's what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.94,0:22:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.30,0:22:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Hulemy, I am back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.46,0:22:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.42,0:22:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No memory. The words of\Nthe way over the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.00,0:23:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll move on to the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.14,0:23:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep my own love.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.74,0:23:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep my own memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.65,0:23:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I can't wait for my own time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.52,0:23:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep my own love.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.42,0:23:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep my own love.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.88,0:23:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.06,0:23:40.05,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.06,0:23:40.05,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (lower right),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs19\pos(404,299)}The Dark Forest Stratum
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.82,0:23:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again!

